[{"id":2862572279,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6qn2L3","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"I recommend using `Span<char` instead for this. With `const char *`, you're forcing downstream to parse the string unnecessarily.\r\n\r\nAlso, doesn't `draw_graph.begin_label` still takes `String`, if I'm seeing correctly. It should also be changed to use `Span<char>` instead. Otherwise, you're just allocating from `const char *` to `String` here.\r\n... But then again, going down further, it looks like `command_label_chars` is just used to be appended to a `String` again. Why is it using UTF-8 in the first place?","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106732#pullrequestreview-2862572279","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106732","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-05-22T21:06:41Z"},{"id":2862774422,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6qoniW","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106732#pull